{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"rose-dawn","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Rose Dawn","description":"Soho vibes: muted roses and golds on a dark base.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Rose Dawn","path":"themes/rose-dawn.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/rose-dawn.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Rose Dawn\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#191724\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#e0def4\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#1f1d2e\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#16141f\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#16141f\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#1f1d2e\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#26233a\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#403d52\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#26233a\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#1f1d2e\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#16141f\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#ebbcba\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#ebbcba\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#ebbcba\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#403d52\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#26233a80\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#ebbcba\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#16141f\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#eb6f92\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#9ccfd8\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#f6c177\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#eb6f92\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#6e6a86\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f6c177\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ebbcba\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#31748f\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9ccfd8\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c4a7e7\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ebbcba\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9ccfd8\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#eb6f92\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f6c177\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c4a7e7\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Rose Dawn\n\nSoho vibes: muted roses and golds on a dark base.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Rose Dawn** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Rosé Pine palette (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#191724` |\n| Text | `#e0def4` |\n| Accent | `#ebbcba` |\n| Keywords | `#31748f` |\n| Strings | `#f6c177` |\n| Functions | `#c4a7e7` |\n| Types | `#9ccfd8` |\n| Comments | `#6e6a86` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}